<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND 156 ALL OUT V ZIMBABWE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 156 ALL OUT V ZIMBABWE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were dismissed for 156 on</p>
<p>the second day of the second test against Zimbabwe at Harare</p>
<p>Sports Club on Friday.</p>
</text>
